quote":"宣曲任氏之先，為督道倉吏。秦之敗也，豪傑皆爭取金玉，而任氏獨窖倉粟。楚漢相距滎陽也，民不得耕種，米石至萬，而豪傑金玉盡歸任氏，任氏以此起富。富人爭奢侈，而任氏折節為儉，力田畜。田畜人爭取賤賈，任氏獨取貴善。富者數世。然任公家約，非田畜所出弗衣食，公事不畢則身不得飲酒食肉。以此為閭里率，故富而主上重之。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji129-007:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi:p037","start":8,"end":12,"surface":"督道倉吏","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi:m037-0002","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"原句官爵或尊稱用語按原字保存，不推授任年月；比封君、擬於人君與素封是比擬，不記實際爵位。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi:p037","text":"宣曲任氏之先，為督道倉吏。秦之敗也，豪傑皆爭取金玉，而任氏獨窖倉粟。楚漢相距滎陽也，民不得耕種，米石至萬，而豪傑金玉盡歸任氏，任氏以此起富。富人爭奢侈，而任氏折節為儉，力田畜。田畜人爭取賤賈，任氏獨取貴善。富者數世。然任公家約，非田畜所出弗衣食，公事不畢則身不得飲酒食肉。以此為閭里率，故富而主上重之。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi:m037-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"任氏","kind":"person","person_id":"0ss_lx4_rht","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi:m037-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"任氏","kind":"person","person_id":"0ss_lx4_rht","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi:m037-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"任氏","kind":"person","person_id":"0ss_lx4_rht","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi:m037-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"任氏","kind":"person","person_id":"0ss_lx4_rht","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi:m037-0077","start":77,"end":79,"surface":"任氏","kind":"person","person_id":"0ss_lx4_rht","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi:m037-0096","start":96,"end":98,"surface":"任氏","kind":"person","person_id":"0ss_lx4_rht","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id"